# GOV-272: run/acceptance/verification logs are local/vault-only, not GitHub
# artifacts (data-publication boundary). These two were tracked from the WEI era
# but are summary-only evidence (SHA256s + pass/fail counts, no raw corpus/PII);
# untracked via `git rm --cached`, preserved in git history + on local disk.
# This supersedes the prior "deliberately committed" note for acceptance.log.
Logs/acceptance.log
Logs/phase2-pilot-verification.log
# Lane 2 AI gateway (GOV-89 / 1.09 §7.1, 1.11 §2.1): the local provider config
